# Site repositories the documentation gate should also check.
#
# One absolute path per line. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
# Copy this file to `site-repos.conf` and edit. With no such file, the runner
# says so out loud rather than printing nothing — because printing nothing reads
# as "checked, all fine", and that is the failure this system exists to stop.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: a site repository's own CLAUDE.md is the documentation that
# drifts hardest. Nobody re-reads it and no program was looking at it. The first
# run across a real estate produced three findings — and all three were false
# positives of the gate, which is what led to narrowing check D1. See trap §27.

# /home/you/projects/example-site
# /home/you/projects/another-site
